e 'The summary timed out - please try again' in the conversation, with no partial summary text, when the summary backend does not respond within 30 seconds.\\n\\n**After (steps):** Keep the four existing steps unchanged and add one `and` step so the steps cover the \\\"no partial summary text\\\" part of the revised description.\\n```yaml\\nsteps:\\n  - given: \\\"a Google Doc is shared with the Claude User's account\\\"\\n  - given: \\\"the summary backend does not respond within 30 seconds\\\"\\n  - when: \\\"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the document\\\"\\n  - then: \\\"Claude displays the message 'The summary timed out - please try again'\\\"\\n  - and: \\\"Claude does not display any partial summary text\\\"\\n```\\n\\nNo new acceptance criteria are added, and none are merged or removed. AC-1 (summary produced), AC-2 (document not accessible), AC-3 (backend timeout) and AC-4 (document over the 10000-word limit) each cover a distinct trigger condition, so there are no duplicates to collapse.\\n\\n## Complete Fixed Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n```yaml\\n- ac_id: AC-1\\n  description: \\\"Claude must display a summary of 150 words or fewer in the conversation when the Claude User asks for a summary of a shared Google Doc.\\\"\\n  steps:\\n    - given: \\\"a Google Doc with at least 500 words of body text is shared with the Claude User's account\\\"\\n    - when: \\\"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize the document\\\"\\n    - then: \\\"Claude displays a summary of 150 words or fewer in the conversation\\\"\\n    - and: \\\"the summary names the document title\\\"\\n\\n- ac_id: AC-2\\n  description: \\\"Claude must display the message 'This document is not shared with your account' when the Claude User asks for a summary of a document they cannot access.\\\"\\n  steps:\\n    - given: \\\"a Google Doc exists that is not shared with the Claude User's account\\\"\\n    - when: \\\"the Claude User asks Claude to summarize that document\\\"\\n    - then: \\\